WEBVTT

NOTE A steady-paced stage rehearsal. English captions.

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.999
A performer begins six
meters from a floor mark.

2
00:00:03.649 --> 00:00:07.210
During this rehearsal, assume
a steady pace until arrival.

3
00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.998
After four seconds, three meters remain.

4
00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:19.176
Elapsed time increased while
distance remaining decreased.

5
00:00:19.926 --> 00:00:21.872
How long will the full approach take?

6
00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.785
Save a prediction before using the graph.

7
00:00:25.235 --> 00:00:28.041
You can revise your thinking
after the worked example.
